            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Hermann Hesse</strong><br>\nHermann Hesse was born on July 2, 1877, in Calw, Germany, to a family with a strong Christian background. His parents served as missionaries in India before his birth, which influenced Hesse's later interest in Eastern philosophy. Growing up, Hesse was a headstrong child who found it difficult to conform to the strict discipline of the schools he attended. He began to show a keen interest in literature at a young age, spending much time reading and deciding to become a writer.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Hesse's Initial Writings</strong><br>\nHesse began his writing career as a bookshop apprentice and later worked for a clock factory. His first novel, \"Peter Camenzind,\" was published in 1904 and received critical acclaim. The novel reflected his love for nature and the struggles of an artist, themes that would recur throughout his work. The success of his early works allowed Hesse to devote himself fully to writing.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Spiritual and Philosophical Influences</strong><br>\nHesse's work was deeply influenced by his preoccupation with individual spirituality and the human psyche. His novels often explored the theme of an individual's search for authenticity, self-knowledge, and spirituality. He was drawn to Eastern philosophy, particularly to Buddhism and Hinduism, which resonated through his novels, including \"Siddhartha\" and \"Steppenwolf.\"</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
